{"id": "4190b83a-b2f4-44b2-9efb-c2b1e591c97f", "slug": "neurosync-cognitive-analytics-1", "title": "NeuroSync - Cognitive Analytics", "description": "Neurosync Cognitive Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"NeuroSync - Cognitive Analytics\"\ndescription: \"Neurosync Cognitive Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#22D3EE\"\n  secondary: \"#141424\"\n  accent: \"#60A5FA\"\n  background: \"#030308\"\n  surface: \"#141424\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# NeuroSync - Cognitive Analytics\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 46; favorites: 6; remixes: 2.\nTags: feature, section, animated, cta, bento, charts.\n## Overview\nNeurosync Cognitive Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nNeuroSync Features Integrations Enterprise Pricing Get Started AI-Powered Insights Think Faster. Master Your Mind. Real-time cognitive analytics that help you understand, optimize, and elevate your mental performance. R…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Think Faster. Master Your Mind.; Cognitive Load Tracking; Neural Pathway Mapping; Adaptive Focus Protocols.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #22D3EE, secondary #141424, accent #60A5FA, background #030308, surface #141424, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>NeuroSync - Cognitive Analytics</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#030308] text-white overflow-x-hidden antialiased selection:bg-purple-500/30 selection:text-white\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background Canvas -->\n    <canvas id=\"gl-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col min-h-screen\">\n        <!-- Navigation -->\n        <header class=\"container mx-auto px-6 py-6 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/5\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:infinity-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-purple-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"text-base font-medium tracking-tight\">NeuroSync</span>\n            </div>\n            <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Features</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Integrations</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Enterprise</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Pricing</a>\n            </nav>\n            <button class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 border border-white/10 rounded-lg text-sm hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors\">\n                Get Started\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-base text-gray-400\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"md:hidden text-2xl text-gray-400\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Main Content -->\n        <main class=\"flex-grow container mx-auto px-6 py-20 lg:py-32 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-8 items-center\">\n\n            <!-- Left Column: Hero Copy -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-start max-w-xl\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-6\">\n                    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-500 animate-pulse\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-widest text-gray-400 uppercase\">AI-Powered Insights</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- GSAP Masked Reveal Target -->\n                <h1 class=\"text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-semibold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] flex flex-wrap gap-x-3 gap-y-2\">\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">Think</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">Faster.</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">Master</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">Your</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500 to-blue-500 pb-2\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">Mind.</span></span>\n                </h1>\n\n                <p class=\"text-base lg:text-lg text-gray-400 mt-8 leading-relaxed max-w-md\">\n                    Real-time cognitive analytics that help you understand, optimize, and elevate your mental performance.\n                </p>\n\n                <!-- Gradient Border Button -->\n                <button class=\"relative p-[1px] mt-10 group overflow-hidden rounded-xl w-max\">\n                    <span class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-600/60 to-blue-600/20 rounded-xl group-hover:from-purple-500/80 group-hover:to-blue-500/40 transition-colors duration-500\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"relative flex items-center gap-3 px-6 py-3.5 bg-[#05050f] rounded-xl text-sm font-medium hover:bg-[#080816] transition-colors\">\n                        Request Access\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-blue-400 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </span>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Column: Feature Cards -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 w-full max-w-lg ml-auto relative\">\n                <!-- Decorative ambient glow behind cards -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-l from-blue-500/5 to-transparent blur-3xl -z-10 rounded-full\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Card 1 -->\n                <div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-[#0a0a14]/60 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center gap-6 hover:bg-[#10101e]/80 transition-colors cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-[#141424] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pulse-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-purple-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(192,132,252,0.5)]\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex-grow\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white group-hover:text-purple-300 transition-colors\">Cognitive Load Tracking</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1\">Real-time mental bandwidth metrics.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 group-hover:text-white group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all shrink-0\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 2 -->\n                <div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-[#0a0a14]/60 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center gap-6 hover:bg-[#10101e]/80 transition-colors cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-[#141424] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:share-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-blue-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(96,165,250,0.5)]\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex-grow\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white group-hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors\">Neural Pathway Mapping</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1\">Visualizing thought patterns and flow states.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 group-hover:text-white group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all shrink-0\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 3 -->\n                <div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-[#0a0a14]/60 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center gap-6 hover:bg-[#10101e]/80 transition-colors cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-[#141424] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:target-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-cyan-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(34,211,238,0.5)]\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex-grow\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white group-hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors\">Adaptive Focus Protocols</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1\">AI-driven routines for peak concentration.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 group-hover:text-white group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all shrink-0\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Scripts for Logic and Animation -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n\n            // --- GSAP Masked Word Reveal ---\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            gsap.to(\".reveal-word\", {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                ease: \"power3.out\",\n                duration: 1,\n                stagger: 0.15,\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: \"h1\",\n                    start: \"top 85%\",\n                }\n            });\n\n\n            // --- Three.js WebGL Background (Glowing Upward Lines) ---\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('gl-canvas');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n            // Camera setup looking slightly down at a central column\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(60, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            camera.position.set(0, 5, 25);\n            camera.lookAt(0, 10, 0);\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas: canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n            // Create materials for the lines (Purple and Blue)\n            const matPurple = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({\n                color: 0x9333ea, // tailwind purple-600\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.5,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n            });\n            const matBlue = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({\n                color: 0x3b82f6, // tailwind blue-500\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.5,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n            });\n\n            // Create thin, vertical planes to act as light streaks\n            const lineCount = 400;\n            const lines = [];\n            const geo = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(0.04, 1);\n            geo.translate(0, 0.5, 0); // Origin at bottom of plane\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < lineCount; i++) {\n                const material = Math.random() > 0.4 ? matPurple : matBlue;\n                const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geo, material);\n\n                // Setup initial state and custom animation properties\n                mesh.userData = {\n                    // Start spread around the center\n                    baseX: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 8,\n                    baseZ: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 8,\n                    // Different speeds and lengths\n                    speed: Math.random() * 0.1 + 0.02,\n                    length: Math.random() * 6 + 2,\n                    // Curve intensity outward as it goes up\n                    curve: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.15,\n                    // Phase offset for opacity pulse\n                    pulsePhase: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2\n                };\n\n                mesh.scale.y = mesh.userData.length;\n                mesh.position.y = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 50; // Random starting height\n\n                scene.add(mesh);\n                lines.push(mesh);\n            }\n\n            // Central faint glow (behind lines)\n            const glowGeo = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(30, 60);\n            const glowMat = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({\n                color: 0x4c1d95, // deep purple\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.05,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n            });\n            const glowMesh = new THREE.Mesh(glowGeo, glowMat);\n            glowMesh.position.z = -5;\n            scene.add(glowMesh);\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            function animate() {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                const time = Date.now() * 0.001;\n\n                lines.forEach(line => {\n                    // Move upwards\n                    line.position.y += line.userData.speed;\n\n                    // Calculate curve: expands outward as y increases\n                    const heightFactor = Math.max(0, (line.position.y + 10) / 10);\n                    line.position.x = line.userData.baseX + (line.userData.baseX * heightFactor * line.userData.curve);\n                    line.position.z = line.userData.baseZ + (line.userData.baseZ * heightFactor * line.userData.curve);\n\n                    // Reset when reaching top\n                    if (line.position.y > 35) {\n                        line.position.y = -15;\n                        line.position.x = line.userData.baseX;\n                        line.position.z = line.userData.baseZ;\n                    }\n\n                    // Dynamic opacity based on height and a sine pulse\n                    let heightOpacity = 1;\n                    if (line.position.y < -5) heightOpacity = (line.position.y + 15) / 10;\n                    else if (line.position.y > 20) heightOpacity = 1 - ((line.position.y - 20) / 15);\n\n                    const pulse = (Math.sin(time * 2 + line.userData.pulsePhase) + 1) / 2; // 0 to 1\n                    line.material.opacity = Math.max(0, Math.min(0.8, heightOpacity * (0.3 + pulse * 0.5)));\n                });\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            }\n\n            animate();\n\n            // Handle Resize\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "neurosync-cognitive-analytics-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/neurosync-cognitive-analytics-1.jpg", "source_name": "neurosync-cognitive-analytics-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 107, "forks": 6, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T00:28:34.609719+00:00"}